{"id":"wb-1-66","name":"房山云居寺塔及石经","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"房山云居寺塔及石经","text":"房山云居寺塔及石经是北京市房山区云居寺中，隋至金代的佛教建筑遗迹。\n1956年9月7日，河北省人民委员会将石经窟、云居寺北塔列入河北省第一批文物保护名单。1961年3月4日，中国国务院以房山云居寺塔及石经之名列为第一批全国重点文物保护单位。2013年，公布第七批全国重点文物保护单位，房山大白玉塘采石场遗址归入房山云居寺塔及石经。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%B1%E4%BA%91%E5%B1%85%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94%E5%8F%8A%E7%9F%B3%E7%BB%8F","revisionId":93931430,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93931430","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0bd2944e1149a9ce5613b1bc.jpg","title":"Pagoda_built_in_Liao_Dynasty_of_Yunju_Temple,_2016-09-08.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pagoda_built_in_Liao_Dynasty_of_Yunju_Temple,_2016-09-08.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/Pagoda_built_in_Liao_Dynasty_of_Yunju_Temple%2C_2016-09-08.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​房山云居寺辽塔","width":320,"height":480}}